    "Result": "Li Ming's and Li Yang's day hi, I'm Li Ming. I get up at seven o'clock every day. I brush my teeth and wash my face. What time does Li Liang get up? Then I have breakfast. I go to school. At half past seven, my little brother Li young gets up at eight o'clock. Then he drinks some milk. I have four lessons in the morning. I read books and work with my friends. Li Li Yang likes drawing pictures.What time does Li Ming come home? I get home at a quarter to five, I play with my brother. I read a story to Li Yang. At a quarter to nine, we go to bed at nine o'clock. Good night, kids.",
